{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45132","headline":"同卢使君幼平郊外送阎侍御归台 · 皎然","name":"同卢使君幼平郊外送阎侍御归台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"留饯飞旌驻，离亭草色间。\n柏台今上客，竹使旧朝班。\n日落东西水，天寒远近山。\n古江分楚望，残柳入隋关。\n恋阙心常积，回轩日不闲。\n芳辰倚门道，犹得及春还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}